{"skill":{"slug":"one-drive","displayName":"Microsoft OneDrive"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790939348398,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":61739,"sha256":"5200413aecc9f284ca3b74bc4a88064ea3f2d2138598e10e315601600e19270d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2275,"sha256":"70524e632cb2814fa251b264277168c45e9e3b66f23264c253ce2be8f58156a0","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790964978506,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a4bc855f87d1f1c67432062060073c04d32e586c000ae960fceb9d535d324a17","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a4bc855f87d1f1c67432062060073c04d32e586c000ae960fceb9d535d324a17","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790939511605},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790964978506},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed OneDrive integration that uses Maton/Microsoft Graph for user-approved file operations, with clear warnings around writes, sharing, credentials, and automation.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, OAuth browser login, OS credential-store use, and Microsoft Graph access are proportionate for a OneDrive API integration and are disclosed.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill installs a pinned Maton CLI via npm or Homebrew and also documents optional SDK packages and a raw HTTPS fallback; this is purpose-aligned but users should verify they trust Maton and the pinned versions before installing.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions repeatedly require explicit user approval for new connections, writes, deletions, sharing links, hosted functions, trigger destinations, and local --exec automation; fetched third-party content is treated as untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill can create persistent hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and stored OAuth/API credentials, but it documents these as non-default or approval-gated workflows with cleanup and least-privilege guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is OneDrive file, folder, drive, and sharing management; the documented OAuth, CRUD, upload/download, search, and sharing capabilities match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let Maton mediate access to your OneDrive account. Prefer OAuth over API keys, approve only the specific account and scopes needed, review every write/share/delete operation before it runs, and be especially careful with anonymous sharing links or persistent triggers that forward data automatically.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790964978506}}}}}